    "A real backup process is SIGKILLed at a disposable FIFO after the database copy and before the completion marker. Partial restore is refused before installation creation, output is not overwritten, and a new backup restores the original rows.",
    "The schema-6 executable regression passes through the same current binary and shared deadline; its own historical failure fixture remains scoped as before.",
    "An independent loopback provider accepts one effect without delivering ACK. Actual snapshot restoration preserves the uncertain effect and original invocation grant; worker polls and repeated public replay do not POST again. Current cancellation denies the restored grant."
